ainer width="1000" height="21" alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="12" color="#7C8A93" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">数据：tmp/20261008T1615Z-run01/B06/research/demo.json（b06data.py，seed=20261011）｜图形：环形刻度与扇形带用图元逼近，服务无矢量 path。</Text></Container></Positioned></Stack></Container></Snapshot>